<td style="text-align: left;">Around the Clock Fat Singles + Bullseye</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Smooth elbow hinge, rhythmic release</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Relaxed board rotation across quadrants (aim for ≤24 darts as untimed goal)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;"><strong>05:00 – 10:00</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Heavy Scoring Power</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">8–10 Visits at Treble 20 (24–30 Darts total)</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Vertical grouping, stacking darts</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Aim for ≥15–20 drill points (e.g. 4–5 trebles [12–15 pts] + steady singles)</td>
</tr>
