<td style="text-align: center;"><strong>10:00 – 15:00</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Doubles Precision</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Bob's 27 (or High Doubles: D20, D16, D10, D8)</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Target alignment on outer wire</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Complete D20 with a positive running score</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;"><strong>15:00 – 20:00</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Pressure Finishing</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">50-Up / 50-Down Ladder (or Catch 40: 61–75)</td>
